# sup2api's root .gitignore ignores names that are source in this tree (reconstructed/vendor/,
# vendor packages' own dist/ and build/ dirs, AGENTS.md, tests …): re-include them here first;
# this tree's own ignores follow and win.
!vendor/
!dist/
!build/
!release/
!tests
!tmp/
!temp/
!AGENTS.md
!*.out
!*.tmp
!*.bak
!*.test
!.cache/

node_modules/
artifacts/official/claude-linux-x64
artifacts/tmp/
vendor-ref/node_modules/
analysis/scan/
analysis/reference/
analysis/vendor/index/
*.log
.rn-tmp/
runnable/
/build/
nul
reconstructed/dist/
# official binaries of other versions (manifests are tracked); tools/extract/acquire.mjs fetches them
artifacts/official/*/claude-linux-x64
# restored trees and equiv pairings of other versions (regenerable, tools/versions/README.md)
artifacts/versions/
# capture logs migrated from sup2api are evidence, not build logs
!research/**/*.log
# 2.1.88 reference source, fetched by tools/fetch-references.sh (was a submodule)
/references/claude-code-analysis/
